 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_CHOIR_CIV5_TEXT_1','Beneath the mountains, the Hollow Choir preserves ancient memories in translucent violet crystals. Patient voices resonate through silver-veined underground cathedrals, carrying knowledge and culture across the ages.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_CHOIR_CIV5_HEADING_2','Songs Beneath Stone'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_CHOIR_CIV5_TEXT_2','Cities on Hills receive +1 [ICON_PRODUCTION] Production, including captured cities. Cities gain +1 [ICON_PEACE] Faith per adjacent Mountain, up to +2 Faith. Mountain ownership is not required; Faith does not require a Hill city.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_CHOIR_CIV5_FACTOID_HEADING','The Enduring Song'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_CHOIR_CIV5_FACTOID_TEXT','The Choir preserves memories in resonating crystal.'),
